<title>SINGAPORE: FCC appoints new group managing director.</title>
<headline>FCC appoints new group managing director.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Property group First Capital Corporation (FCC) said on Wednesday executive director Lay Kok Weng, 44, has been appointed group managing director with effect from November 20.</p>
<p>The company also announced the resignation of director Billy Lee Beng Cheng.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703083)</p>
